      <h1>How to Automate Lead Follow-Up: 5-Step Sequence</h1>
      <div class="post-meta">
        <span>By <a href="/about/"><strong>Kevin Freeland</strong></a></span>
        <span>March 14, 2026</span>
        <span>8 min read</span>
      </div>
    </div>
